      "description": "Jobs | Lightricks Job Title 1 list_js_custom_department list_js_parent_department (If exist) : list_js_child_department Office Name Jobs search collection No matching result section Meet our teams 5 Positions R&D {total jobs} Available positions Creative & Design {total jobs} Available positions Data {total jobs} Available positions Marketing {total jobs} Available positions Marketing {total jobs} Available positions Who we are Lightricks is reimagining the way creators express themselves. We use innovative technology and fine-tuned design to reshape the creator experience. Our suite of tools and services, including Facetune, Videoleap, Photoleap, and Popular Pays, have changed the way millions of people create. Join us and take part in building the future of content creation. Our values Create fun We’re all about creation, passion, and keeping the workplace playful. Embrace change The creative process is fluid and always reflects transformation. Get things done We look beyond the task and turn thoughts into actions. Invest in people Because we know that it’s our people who make us who we are. Strong opinions, loosely held We speak up and listen because we know great ideas can come from anyone. Places we currently hire in Location {total jobs} Available Positions Location {total jobs} Available Positions Location {total jobs} Available Positions Location {total jobs} Available Positions Location {total jobs} Available Positions Our culture: Work hard & have fun We offer a vibrant workplace that is fulfilling and rewarding, where employees know they can make an impact. We invest in our people by offering them learning opportunities and room for collaboration, ideas that are both essential to our DNA. Our locations: Creation is everywhere We have a number of international offices with each location focusing on certain teams and specialties. Join us in one of our global locations: Jerusalem, Haifa, London, Shenzhen, and across the United States as