      "id": "3f5db66e5d491bfc22cc",
      "title": "Open world models & multimodal AI View LTX roles →",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://ltx.io/careers",
      "description": "Careers at LTX | Build World Models Infrastructure Get API Key Talk to Sales LTX, built by Lightricks, was born from a decade of enabling hundreds of millions of people to create. Our models integrate directly into production workflows, delivering high-fidelity, scalable creation while preserving control over process, workflows, and IP. Open roles Research Location Research Scientist - Audiovisual Generation, Model Foundations Full-time Jerusalem Where research meets the real world 01 Shape where AI goes AI moves fast, but little of it reaches production. Here your work ships into studio and enterprise pipelines and a global open-source community. Weeks, not years, from idea to impact. 02 Hard problems, end to end Model architecture, video and audio generation, efficiency, multimodal inputs, on-device deployment, and creative tooling. Small teams own projects from research to release. 03 Open by default We build in the open because it makes the work better: sharper research, faster collaboration, and a direct line to the community building on our models. Clear, candid, low on bureaucracy. 04 Built on teamwork Breakthroughs start with great people and a collaborative mindset, one that encourages exploration, creativity, and experimentation. Help us build what creation needs next New systems for real production, open to everyone. Will you help shape them? What makes us \"us\" And hopefully you too Our Hiring Process Winning mindset Excellence as an ongoing pursuit, not a finish line Innovative & creative We don't chase trends. We build what's next. Flexible A learning culture: build, break, iterate, repeat Proactive We spot it and act before it becomes a problem Effective communicator Clear, candid, and always listening Collaborative Ownership without ego. Wins are shared. Benefits & Perks Your growth Financial Wellbeing Getting to the office Full, open access to the world's leading AI tools, as they emerge. Conference and research budget. Annual personal development budget. 1:1 coaching and mentoring. Cross-team learning programs. Global Comprehensive health insurance. Generous PTO. Paid enhanced maternity and paternity leave. US 401(k) with company match. UK Life assurance coverage. Enhanced pension contributions and education fund. Israel Hishtalmut fund. Global Daily meal benefits. Mental health support and wellness programs. Wellness subsidies. Israel HQ sports classes: yoga, pilates, jiu-jitsu. Two chef-run restaurants operated by Mahane Yehuda. HQ pampering: hairdresser, manicures, and shiatsu. HQ seamstress. In-office bakery with fresh pastries daily. We work on a hybrid model, and when you come in, getting there is on us: Jerusalem HQ Daily shuttles from Central Israel. GoTo carpool subscriptions. Subsidized train travel. UK Monthly transport allowance / season ticket loan. US Pre-tax commuter benefits. We didn't wait for the future. Neither should you. Bring your craft to the team building open, production-ready creative AI. See Open Roles 200+ People building creative AI 5 Global sites across the US, UK & Israel #1 Open weights text-to-video & image-to-video LTX-2.5 Our latest open weights AI model // FAQs What does LTX's hybrid work model look like? Our hybrid model combines the best of both worlds: time to collaborate and connect in the office, and the freedom to focus from home when it fits best. Teams usually coordinate their office days to stay aligned, inspired, and connected. Most teams mix 3-4 office days with remote days. What resources and tools does LTX provide to help me grow and succeed? We invest in your growth from day one. You'll receive an annual learning and wellbeing budget, one-on-one coaching, skill-boosting courses, and tech guilds. You'll also have access to frontier AI models (Claude, ChatGPT, and Gemini), premium AI subscriptions, and best-in-class development tools. I know someone who works at LTX. Can they refer me? Sure, reach out to them before you apply. They can submit your details internally, so don't forget to send them your CV/resume and any other information they might need. Can I connect with people who work in the team I want to join? Yes. We can’t share employees’ contact information, but feel free to send them a LinkedIn message and connect with them there. Can I re-apply for a role? If the role is still open, and it's been at least six months since your last interview, go ahead. You're also welcome to apply for other open positions. Home Careers Open foundation models for video, audio, and world simulation Try LTX Now Research LTX-2.5 LTX-2.3 LTX-2 LTXV Developer Program Academic Programs Physical AI Developer Program Interfaces Licensing LTX API LTX Studio LTX Desktop LTX Trainer LTX Playground Open Source Open Source HuggingFace GitHub Documentation Community Library Discord X Resources Blog Tutorials Case Studies Models Overview Release Notes Documentation API Status Glossary LLM Info LTX Model Alternatives Pricing Licensing API Pricing LTX Studio Pricing Company About Events Careers Newsroom Help Center Privacy Policy Cookie Preferences Trust Center Accessibility CCPA Privacy notice © 2026 All rights reserved",
