      "id": "9f1812478e410af482b8",
      "title": "The #1 AI photo and video editor app View Facetune roles →",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.facetuneapp.com/career",
      "description": "Facetune career Who are we We're Facetune, the first product of Lightricks, now a brand of our own, founded in 2013. Ten years in, we've put pro-level editing in the hands of hundreds of millions of people. Today Facetune lives in the everyday: every post, every story, every profile pic. It's AI-first, trend-led, and a little obsessed with design that feels like magic and creates beautiful results in only one tap. Building that takes every kind of mind product, tech, design, data, and marketing moving fast, together. Open roles Research Research Scientist - Audiovisual Generation, Model Foundations Full-time Jerusalem Apply → There are no open positions at this time. Please check back for future opportunities. Why building hits different Our hiring process 01 Ship at the speed of the feed Trends don't wait, so neither do we. Whatever you make - a feature, a model, a campaign, a design system - reaches a global audience in weeks, while it's still the thing everyone's doing. 02 AI that's actually fun to use One-tap enhance, generative hair and outfits, video that tracks a face frame by frame. We take serious AI and make it feel like magic - then put it in millions of hands. 03 The culture sets the brief Our users are young, online, and moving fast. Product, marketing, design, and data all read the feed, catch the vibe, and build for the person holding the phone before anyone else does. Benefits & Perks Your growth Financial Wellbeing Getting here Full, open access to the world's leading AI tools, as they emerge. Conference and learning budget. Annual personal development budget. 1:1 coaching and mentoring. Cross-team learning programs. Global Comprehensive health insurance Generous PTO Paid enhanced maternity and paternity leave. Us 401(k) with company match. Uk Life assurance coverage Enhanced pension contributions and education fund. Israel Hishtalmut fund Global Daily meal benefits. Mental health support and wellness programs. Wellness subsidies. israel HQ sports classes: yoga, pilates, jiu-jitsu Two chef-run restaurants operated by Mahane Yehuda HQ pampering: hairdresser, manicures, and shiatsu HQ seamstress In-office bakery with fresh pastries daily. We work on a hybrid model, and when you come in, getting there is on us: Jerusalem HQ Daily shuttles from Central Israel. GoTo carpool subscriptions. Subsidized train travel. uk Monthly transport allowance / season ticket loan. us Pre-tax commuter benefits. Zero touch-ups. Just who we are. We don't have a Facetune type. We have people who can see more than one kind of beauty. And hopefully you too. See Open Roles Facetune career FAQ What does the hybrid work model look like? Our hybrid model combines the best of both worlds: time to collaborate and connect in the office, and the freedom to focus from home when it fits best. Teams usually coordinate their office days to stay aligned, inspired, and connected. Most teams mix 3–4 office days with remote days. What resources and tools does Facetune provide to help me grow and succeed? We invest in your growth from day one. You'll get an annual learning and wellbeing budget, one-on-one coaching, skill-boosting courses, and tech guilds. You'll also have access to frontier AI models (Claude, ChatGPT, and Gemini), premium AI subscriptions, and best-in-class development tools. I know someone who works here. Can they refer me? Sure, reach out to them before you apply. They can submit your details internally, so don't forget to send them your CV/resume and any other information they might need. Can I connect with people who work in the team I want to join? Yes. We can't share employees' contact information, but feel free to send them a LinkedIn message and connect with them there. Can I re-apply for a role? f the role is still open, and it's been at least six months since your last interview, go ahead. You're also welcome to apply for other open positions. This website is using cookies to improve your user experience. By continuing, you agree to our Cookie Policy.",
